        <title>Frost Advisory issued November 2 at 12:00PM PST until November 3 at 9:00AM PST by NWS Eureka CA</title>
        <summary>* WHAT...Temperatures as low as 33 will result in frost formation.

* WHERE...Northern Mendocino Interior, and Northern Lake.

* WHEN...From midnight tonight to 9 AM PST Tuesday.

* IMPACTS...Frost could harm sensitive outdoor vegetation. Sensitive
outdoor plants may be killed if left uncovered.</summary>
